# corpus/roles-generics
profile own
summary make take role
scope.begin first
call.enter factory make
new r R
object resource hidden=r
role value resource
call.exit factory value
bind value_bind value
object boxed value=value
get unboxed boxed value
use unboxed
check ''
scope.end first
check R
reset.log
scope.begin second
new a A
new b B
array items a b
object inner value=items
object nested value=inner
use nested
scope.end second
check BA
reset.log
scope.begin third
new x X
any opaque x
scope.split third opaque packet
own.dynamic packet third any opaque third
object box value=opaque
use box
check ''
scope.end third
check X
